{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#card-zh","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-pause 是面向 DSH Web 的会话控制插件。它替换 agent loop，并在会话输入栏加入暂停与继续按钮，同时提供 /pause、/pause-cancel 和 /resume 命令。暂停请求会等待当前步骤及其中工具调用结束，在步骤边界将回合标记为 paused 并刷新会话；重新打开已暂停会话后，可从持久化历史继续执行。用户也可在空闲时预先请求暂停，或取消尚未完成的请求。适合需要暂存长任务、重启后接着处理的 DSH Web 用户。安装到 web profile 并使用要求的 Node.js 版本；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-21","lib/index.js:23-85","lib/client.js:116-207","lib/agent-loop.js:532-575"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#card-en","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-pause adds pause and resume controls to DSH Web. Buttons and slash commands request a pause after the current step and tools finish, then persist the session. Reopen it to continue. Requires the supported Node.js version; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-21","lib/index.js:23-85","lib/client.js:116-207","lib/agent-loop.js:532-575"]}
