{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#feature-1","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-pause 的功能「步骤边界暂停」：暂停请求不会中断当前步骤，会等回答与工具调用完成后结束回合并持久化 paused 状态。可通过 /pause 或输入栏按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/agent-loop.js:532-549","lib/agent-loop.js:713-726","lib/client.js:172-183"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#feature-2","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-pause 的功能「暂停后继续」：在暂停状态下使用 /resume 或继续按钮，循环跳过空输入检查，从会话历史接续未完成工作，并处理排队输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/agent-loop.js:567-575","lib/agent-loop.js:688-697","lib/client.js:142-151"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#feature-3","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-pause 的功能「重启后恢复暂停态」：重新载入最后一轮以 paused 结束的会话时，agent 初始状态恢复为 paused，用户可以随后继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/agent-loop.js:386-400"]}
{"unit_id":"watericetangcw__dsh-session-pause#feature-4","repo":"watericetangcw/dsh-session-pause","commit":"0ef5101e053255a5876203f0f05249df326c3675","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-pause 的功能「取消待处理暂停」：暂停按钮等待时可点击取消，或调用 /pause-cancel；循环清除暂停锁存状态，之后的回合按正常流程运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:153-170","lib/index.js:47-58","lib/agent-loop.js:552-565"]}
